{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>周二（17日）大致多雲，初時有一兩陣微雨。早上最低氣溫約23°C。日間部分時間有陽光，最高氣溫約27°C。吹和緩東至東南風，晚間離岸風勢間中清勁。周三（18日）稍後轉吹偏北風，雲量增多，晚上氣溫下降。隨後一兩日顯著轉涼，周五（20日）及周六（21日）市區最低氣溫在15、16°C左右，新界相當清涼。（天文台）</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-16T14:19:09.991481+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":154,"images":0,"source":"明報 消閒","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-16T13:42:40+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-17T07:23:49.179272+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-16T14:12:29.358674+00:00","content_hash":"f5b536be209d6ec4583e8f7626ac6ab658a14b8b03c25fa12b2dcfc7db1a5c3c","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}